TEXT 4088 -88 Left 2 !*.param Lp=42.7\n.param n_turns=0.5\n.param Rref=11.3k\n.param k=0.9999\n \n.param Ls = {Lp*n_turns*n_turns}\n* 96/ 311.283\n \nK15 L53 L54 {k}\n \n* .param Rsec={Rref*n*n}\n.param Rsec=1e6\n \n.param Rp=1\n.param Rs=0\n \n \n.param L_series1 = 1/((2*pi*f)**2 * Cp)\n.param L_series2 = 1/((2*pi*f)**2 * (Cp + Ceq))\n \n.param Lp={if(modelSel==1,L_series2,L_series1)}\n*.param Lp=43.5
